  "class_declaration": "# Each object is the whole 3x3 block that fills the grid. The output sets its top-bottom mirror image below it\nclass Obj(x: int, y: int, width: int, height: int, orientation: int, volume: int):\n    this.x is x\n    this.y is y\n    this.width is width\n    this.height is height\n    this.orientation is orientation\n    this.volume is volume\n    this.tag is l9100",
